### Create band
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "wave-a-demo",
  "name": "Wave A Demo Band",
  "bandType": "product",
  "sppEnabled": 1,
  "geoCode": "MEX"
}

### Add member
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/band-members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bandId": 1,
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "roleInBand": "guitar"
}

### Create rehearsal session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bandId": 1,
  "notes": "Product console rehearsal"
}

### List rehearsals (product path)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/bands/1/rehearsals

### Check-in
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/rehearsal-checkins
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rehearsalSessionId": 1,
  "musicianProfileId": 1,
  "lateMinutes": 0
}

### Open SPP cycle
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/spp-cycles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bandId": 1,
  "code": "WAVE-A-PRODUCT-1",
  "status": "open"
}

### Close cycle
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/spp-cycles/1/close
